{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-05_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-05","title":"典範之名","storyCode":"13-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"43c41748491bf5dfe8206c464af4068069272ec40ee280ef72180020d9210558","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"推進之王與戴菲恩等人救援了發出訊號的號角與Misery等人。在守衛切特雷鎮的作戰中，推進之王最終艱難破壞薩卡茲的移動巫術祭壇，贏得了勝利。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是第一個見到那位斥候的人。\n在我嘗試隔岸偵察對面廣場旁那排死寂的高大市政樓時，他的屍體正死死抓著岸邊的蘆葦在水中搖盪。\n我想，直到最後一刻他也不曾放棄活下去的希望。\n離他不遠處的軍用防水包中安靜地躺著他的筆記，最後一則記錄是他出發前寫下的。\n“我主動申請了這次傳遞求援訊號的任務，任務完成後我不會再回來。”\n“沒人能活下去。”（劃掉）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據他的筆記，那支保護切特雷鎮的小隊現在的情況很不樂觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到對岸的渡口了嗎？那裡原本的渡船都被人鑿沉了，號角小姐的部隊被徹底斷掉了對外通訊的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩天前，這名士兵試圖強行趁夜色游泳渡河，但是被對岸巡邏的薩卡茲用弩箭殺死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，那支原本駐守在廣場市政樓裡的部隊下落完全不明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那名士兵筆記中的內容讓我內心十分不安。\n二十三人，兩個分隊。\n除了在夜色中沉寂的市政樓，廣場周圍的一切都已在炮火中變成了一片廢墟。\n至少那場慘劇讓我牢牢記住了一件事，沒人能做到在戰場上真正逃離死神的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從戰場環境看，廣場的東、北兩面都被卡慕河包圍，東面的渡口還被薩卡茲把控，南面那邊成片的火光應該就是薩卡茲的軍營。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他們已經在市政樓內堅守了超過兩週。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是筆記情況屬實，至少兩天前，隨著溝通市政樓和北面河對岸居民區的唯一一座剩餘橋梁被薩卡茲襲擊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最壞的情況下，他們很有可能已經失去了所有的補給來源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……彈盡糧絕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有這拖拖拉拉的工夫，還不如早點游過去當面確認一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，就這麼莽撞地強行渡河，如果暴露了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，漢娜倒是提醒了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在號角小姐隊伍的軍事電台訊號完全緘默，當務之急是恢復和他們的聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我的想法是由我、漢娜、摩根還有達格達輕裝潛水渡河，先摸進市政樓內確認情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，維娜小姐，這太冒險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該也清楚，這支隊伍裡，只有我們最適合這個任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是羅德島的幹員，熟悉以小隊為編組的特種作戰任務。我們還是諾伯特區的混混，知道怎麼偷偷摸摸進去，悄無聲息離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有幾個士兵和市民自願跟了上來，他們也想要支援那支曾聲名遠揚的“風暴突擊隊”，但我們不能帶走太多人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉走後，我們不能無視隊伍防衛空虛的事實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我沒怎麼聽維娜接下來的說詞。\n這是“灰禮帽”惡劣的玩笑嗎？還是……這就是戰場上的常態？\n求救訊號，救與不救，還有救一些人總要犧牲一些人的……規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩……我知道你在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是個摻雜了個人感情的行動，但我不能無視那個求援訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他們都是出色的戰士。只要他們活著，就會是好幫手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。我相信你的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你和這幾位戰士留在外面，我們需要外圍崗哨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦失去我們的訊號，你立刻帶他們撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活著回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們已經游到了岸邊，需要確認是否有巡邏隊伍出現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"渡口哨崗有兩名薩卡茲，其中一個就在漢娜的三點鐘方向，另一個在屋內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"摩根吸引另外一個人注意，我和漢娜同時動手……準備……動手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看到窗口的燈熄滅了。\n……順利嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等……羽獸？\n一隻漆黑的羽獸飛掠出渡口的小屋，盤旋於渡口上空一周，直奔薩卡茲軍營的方向而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……維娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而另一道矯捷的黑影踩踏著小屋凌空而起，跨越月光將羽獸攏入懷中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我抓到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"漢娜，你嚇到它了！這是軍用羽獸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"老子也沒注意到嘛……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們開始向市政樓靠近，沿途沒有薩卡茲的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"廣場上有很多屍體，天色太黑無法辨認身份……準備進入市政樓……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我看到了那座連通居民區的大橋。但是橋對面架設了大量防禦工事，視野受到影響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想辦法到高點確認，去市政樓頂部！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"收到，嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"入口全被木板封死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"來我這，西側外牆有一道被炸出的缺口足夠我們進入。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了……有看到號角小姐的部隊嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"暫時沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"停！有動靜！所有人關閉通訊，窗口有未知身份的弩手在樓內偵察對岸居民區，看我手勢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":true,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*這個頻段有聲音？誰*滋——*"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"訊號完全陷入了寂靜。\n之後短短的十分鐘，我沒有收到來自她們的任何通訊。\n大樓裡到底有多少人？求援的部隊情況如何？維娜她們的行動是否已經暴露？\n我一無所知。\n我趴在岸堤的土地上，心跳聲越來越沉重。\n它匯入了卡慕河，與水流聲共鳴，越來越快，越來越湍急——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她們暴露了？\n等等，樓頂有人站在月亮前招手？那是……維娜嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這裡是推進之王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"風暴突擊隊號角，我已經接入了你們的頻道，是否收到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們收到了你們的求援訊號，已確認你們的位置——對岸居民區橋口防禦陣地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們來救你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“滋——滋——”\n頻道裡傳來了一陣歡呼。\n她們做到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"對不起，大伙有點激動，你們是第一支到達的支援力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"現在頻道恢復正常了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"號角小姐，我們有把握幫助你們小隊撤離——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"感謝你，但是抱歉，我們不會撤離。鎮裡有薩卡茲想要的東西，他們不會放棄進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"最近一支收到我們求援訊號的維多利亞部隊會在最晚一週後到達，我們必須守住入口，到時我們身後切特雷鎮的倖存者才能安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"*嘈雜的通訊聲*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這是我們全票通過後的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"包括了……Misery先生。感謝他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頻道一片死寂。\n她聲音聽上去很輕鬆。\n投票。戰場上的投票唯有兩個選擇，生與死。\n維娜似乎陷入了思考，如果是我，會怎麼決斷？如果是媽媽呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"既然你們選擇孤注一擲，我有個更大膽的計劃也許你想聽聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我支持維娜小姐並不是因為她王儲的身份。\n她有著我所不具備，一股不願服輸的勇氣。\n當然，有些人稱之為，魯莽。\n但我依然期待，期待她能堅持走到那一步，期待她能在地獄裡找到一條離開的路。\n我必須……如此相信。我才能從那個地獄裡走出來。\n我甚至沒法去想那天的事。\n戴菲恩……戴菲恩，先專注眼前。\n哨戒任務已結束，該去和她們會合了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天快亮了……我們的準備工作到什麼地步了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內部門窗加固很順利，周圍的暗哨Misery先生也清理得很乾淨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"我會繼續在外圍警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"軍營的情況我會隨時和你們同步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦您了，Misery先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從倫蒂尼姆分頭行動時約定好去布倫特伍德鎮會合，為什麼你們會出現在切特雷鎮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們路過時Misery先生發現了異樣，剛好趕上一場屠殺，我們沒辦法放著不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們確定讓我指揮？號角小姐是專業的軍人，戴菲恩也受過最精英的軍事教育。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們在諸王長眠之所的行動，很了不起。你為我們帶回了那把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是根鐵條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵、鐵條，你就這麼稱呼維多利亞的國劍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想著諸王之息了，這話會讓你們失望，但它帶不來什麼奇蹟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能依靠的只有自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……哪怕只是我們自己，也足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的支援已經證明了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡的人員，狀態和物資條件都難以真正執行什麼複雜的戰術。接下來的戰鬥，我們需要的，更多的是決心和勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在災難面前，人本身，比傳說或者神器重要得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，你可以向我們證明這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的隊伍大多不是專業戰鬥人員，佔據高點做好防禦射擊就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些漏進來的薩卡茲……我們幾個作為突擊手，必須以最快的速度清理掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐的部隊會繼續留守橋口防禦陣地部署橋頭轟炸區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會按原計劃繼續阻止薩卡茲強行突破大橋的嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棟樓是他們無法避開的第一道防線，我們首當其衝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做的只是守住一棟樓，聽上去沒有那麼難不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“卡慕河保衛戰”——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，我剛想說這個名字！很酷，值得拍一部電影！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"漢娜，別吵。一點鐘方向一百米有巡邏隊靠近，所有射擊口準備就緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"推進之王，要下令射擊嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看到維娜小姐握錘的手在微微顫抖。\n興奮？恐懼？又或是二者皆有？\n我不知道，我的雙手冰涼無比。\n七天。\n公爵的部隊真的會來嗎？如果失敗了呢？如果有更多薩卡茲察覺到這裡呢？\n我不斷分析各種可能性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在，射擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巡邏隊伍倒地的第一時間，薩卡茲軍營上空的警報開始尖嘯。\n時間沒有留給我思考的餘地……保衛戰，開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"更多的兄弟會踩著我的屍體撕碎你們，*薩卡茲粗口*……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會撕碎你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲。\n我又開始想那天的事，不，這樣不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"戴菲恩！九十秒外出行動時間快到了，準備撤退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道，地雷區還有一個缺口。本蒂勒已經倒了，我馬上補上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地雷資源太珍貴，不能就這麼隨便扔在外面不管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"三層射擊點有人增援你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"市政樓地下室和連通到大橋邊的地下通道已經全部清理出來了！進度很快！傷員不用都擠在一起了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"摩根，你剛才受的傷還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"還是不能握刀，但是指揮物資調配問題不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"漢娜，你那邊的進度如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"搞破壞我可太擅長了！根本用不上設備，樓層間的天花板老子可以直接砸出一個洞，上下快速移動的木梯都架好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那就好，昨天來不及支援達格達的意外不能再發生了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地雷區缺口我補上了！好消息是本蒂勒還有氣，我正拖著他回地下室治療！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達小姐今天醒了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"……醒了，但不方便移動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"她太拚命了，我盡量照顧她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"Misery先生，薩卡茲軍營那邊是否有新的動向？他們前三天強行攻樓的成果不大，說不定已經有了新的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"您還能找到更多的地雷讓我們擴大地雷防禦區嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"恐怕不行，我們那位薩卡茲朋友的游擊僱傭兵團的位置可不好找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在能依靠的只有我*電流聲*——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"巫術*電流聲*訊號——擾*電流聲*——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼東西在干擾訊號？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是——*嘈雜的聲音*——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——戴*尖銳的電流聲*——逃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一聲長長的嘯鳴從遠處傳來。\n不安的感覺卻猛地螫住了我，惡意從空氣中瀰漫而來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你終於醒了，戴菲恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……頭很痛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你昨天在外面救人時沒有來得及撤退，他們的移動戰爭祭壇試射波及了你的位置……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……昨天？……移動……戰爭祭壇？本呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，看來我們兩個人都錯過了很多東西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘶，我的背還是很痛，摩根的縫針手藝真不太行。本還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……把我帶回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，她當時發現你還留在外面，就第一時間從三樓的窗戶跳出去把你拖回室內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是剛醒，已經趕去支援維娜了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……都是這次受傷的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我從堆滿傷員的地下通道走過，幾十雙沾滿血污的眼睛正向我示意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的情況很糟糕……我們得趕快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那些地雷起作用了，有兩架戰爭祭壇的移動裝置已經報廢了，其餘幾架也開始觀望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"他們放棄繼續向前推進了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你標記的位置隨後可以馬上進行二輪轟炸支援！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"小心！那些移動戰爭祭壇還在蓄力，他們沒放棄繼續進攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所有人聽老子的命令，第五輪轟擊快到了，還在第一層和第二層的人馬上給我撤到第三層！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那鬼東西的轟擊高度有限！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"如果我沒猜錯，這東西的巫術核心儲備能量需要由操作它的人提供，戰爭祭壇本身只是一個引導媒介。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"也就是說，只要在它蓄能完成的時候幹掉巫術核心就可以讓它炸掉自己，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"理論上可以，但我也是第一次見到這東西出現在戰場上，沒有把握保證——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"知道這些就夠了，我去頂層找機會，只有從高位才有機會接近到巫術核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"Misery先生，你能在祭壇啟動時幫我延緩炮手一下子嗎？哪怕只有一秒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"……我答應你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我愣在了通往二層的樓梯口。\n我花了一些時間才敢相信，左側外牆完全塌掉的建築就是我們駐守超過……也許五天的市政樓。\n不再需要窗戶和瞭望口，廣場就如此突兀地向我展露了它的慘烈細節。\n黎明的暉光中，廢墟中的移動戰爭祭壇支架拱衛的紅色結晶妖異閃耀，它的金屬骨架反射著不祥的光。\n它好像在呢喃著：直視鮮血，直視凋零，直視死亡。\n這就是媽媽始終在做的事情……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……而這是這些日子我唯一一次想起她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，達格達，歡迎回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲……已經大規模裝備了這種武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我不這麼想，這應該也是軍事委員會在維多利亞蟄伏期間實驗出的新東西，設計依舊很簡陋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，你醒了，你看上去狀態不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根可是一直吊著她那隻斷手在照顧你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，摩根。當然還有漢娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，舉手之勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大伙兒，聽著，我想徹底幹掉那些移動祭壇，我還需要你們幫我一個忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要誘餌，我需要有人留在這誘導那些該死的東西開炮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽上去像我能幹的活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我也行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是隨便逞強的時候，那東西的恐怖，我才最有話語權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你的手還沒有恢復。我去配合漢娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還需要一個人隨時待命，一旦我沒有成功，必須要立馬接替我攻擊核心，Misery先生能為我們爭取的時間不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，維娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根……我也需要你隨時關注他們的動向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維娜的計劃並不複雜，等待開炮，錘爆核心，連環爆炸，結束。\n我們等待的只是一個時機，而那個時機已經近在眼前。\n他們已經瞄準我們了。\n猛螫我心臟的惡意讓我噁心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——他們隨時都可能開炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被那鬼東西盯上可真不好受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"Misery先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"隨時可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":true,"text":"動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅色。\n我想起了甲板上的顏色。\n祭壇中的惡魔之眼在直視我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而一道弧形的銀光逼開了惡魔的眼睛。\n匕首劃過了一排薩卡茲炮手的脖子，歡快地跳回了Misery的手裡。\n他們落向核心的手停滯了一剎，在慣性的牽引下繼續著他們死前的決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從天而降的巨錘與紅色的波紋輕輕碰撞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_9"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“砰”。\n維娜如隕石般倒砸回大樓中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能……維娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"半秒。\n祭壇提前啟動的速度超出了我們所有人的預料。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……咳……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨錘深插在破敗的外牆上。\n我在煙塵中看不清任何東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！他們輪換了一批士兵，準備第二次發射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當我揉開眼中的沙礫後，牆上的巨錘已經失去了蹤跡。\n一個身影正飛速攀著外牆向上躥去，此刻手中之錘就是她的鎬，大樓在她的每一次敲擊中顫慄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"達格達！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"達格達拉住了在逆光中早早伸出的那隻手。\n瓦石在維娜反蹬中碎裂，她重新躍向了天空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅色的波紋已然聚積。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，找掩護！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在風暴中抬起了頭。\n她踩著黎明的暉光，金色的毛髮在燃燒。\n高舉的巨錘飛越了天際線，與旭日重疊，融為一體。\n波紋被撕碎，狂暴的力量直奔核心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我失去了聲音。\n唯有光芒刺痛著我的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維娜！維娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些移動祭壇還在連環爆炸，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她暈倒了！該死，濺出來的金屬碎片扎進她胸口了！誰來幫我一把！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把她帶回來！別讓源石粉塵進入傷口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些薩卡茲想撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，看……看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰艦？真的有援軍！那是高多汀公爵的旗幟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結……結束了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結束了！我們*維多利亞粗口*守下來了！太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本！本！快看，我們有救了！本？本……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些*維多利亞粗口*魔族佬想跑，衝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我想，今天之後我一定要在那位斥候的筆記上再多記上一筆。\n“我們活下來了。\n紀念七位犧牲的英雄……\n阿比蓋爾，諾伯特區平民出身；亞歷山卓娜，切特雷鎮平民出身；\n亨德森，奧克特里格區軍人出身；本蒂勒，麗茵卡登軍人出身；\n無名，無法辨別身份；\n無名，無法辨別身份……\n無名，無法（字跡扭曲難以識別，未寫完）”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
